; Recipe Book — "Lyra's First Pages"
; A pressed-leaf folio Lyra hands the player after the Whisperwood apology quest.
; In-world look: birch-paper booklet, marshmint-dyed cord, three pages.
; Discoverable: dropped in the herb-shed inventory on first delivered wolf-pelt.

